      "message": "Apologies for a delayed reply, I was on vacation.\n\nI definitely agree with the idea of doing a cleanup, but I see that all this logic is quite delicate and we should be careful in modifying it to avoid creating surprises.",
      "revId": "ccb660dde2b12d3c7779167f50c3a0ebfd28bb38",
